FTP with OpenSSL: the module ftp of php83-ftp built with FTP over SSL
(ftp_ssl_connect()) on the OpenSSL of the base system. The same files as
php83-ftp: install one of the two.

The module ftp of PHP 8.3 for php83 of azsupport/ports, which installs
side by side with the other versions of PHP: lib/php/20230831/ftp.so,
loaded by its ini in etc/php83/conf.d, its headers in
include/php83/php/ext/ftp.
